      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>An ecstatic psalm envisioning the eventual victory of Humanity over Death itself – the ultimate Victory Day. Although the primary focus is on our ending of the process of biological death, it also touches on the Resurrection of those who have fallen, as well as the defeat of the ultimate Death – that of the Universe itself.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_51323_introduction"/>
